WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.076
All your coding agents. One terminal. One voice.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.108
Which sessions need my attention?

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.383
Your checkout agent asked whether coupons belong in the cart or at checkout.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.215
Tell it checkout.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:11.954
Sent.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.086
Take your agents with you.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.951
Keep work in view. Everything else keeps running.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.269
Schedule the follow-up. Agent bouncer queues the heavy jobs.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.904
Open source. Built in Rust.
